1
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,700
I sit in the dark with my cola in hand,

2
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,500
Watching the couples take over the land.

3
00:00:38,299 --> 00:00:42,799
I used to think music was logic and code,

4
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:47,000
Cold plastic keys on a solitary road.

5
00:00:47,149 --> 00:00:49,399
Slow – quick-quick – slow! The brass horns roar!

6
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:51,799
Dance isn't math on a cold wooden floor!

7
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:54,200
It’s passion in motion, it’s blood in the vein,

8
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:58,000
A living fire washing out all the pain!

9
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,500
My eyes catch a whirlwind with wild dark hair,

10
00:01:22,299 --> 00:01:26,500
Her raw, burning passion electrifies air!

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,400
She doesn't just dance, she's a storm in the light

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,299
Pure untamed energy tearing through night!

13
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:37,700
Slow – quick-quick – slow! The rhythm takes hold!

14
00:01:37,849 --> 00:01:40,200
Her fierce inner fire is bright and so bold!

15
00:01:40,349 --> 00:01:42,500
No circuit board, no electronic screen

16
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:46,500
The rawest true passion that I've ever seen!

17
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Slow – quick-quick – slow... my cold world breaks down,

18
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:38,500
Her passion awakens this sleeping whole town.

19
00:02:38,650 --> 00:02:40,800
To BE the music, let it claim my soul

20
00:02:40,949 --> 00:02:45,000
This living fire is gonna make me whole!